  {
   "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-2-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera la matriz \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&-1\\\\1&\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Determina la matriz \\(B=A^2-2A\\).",
     "(0,75 p.) Determina los valores de \\(\\lambda\\) para los que la matriz \\(B\\) tiene inversa.",
     "(0,75 p.) Calcula \\(B^{-1}\\) para \\(\\lambda=1\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[A^2=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & -1\\\\1 & \\lambda\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1 & -1\\\\1 & \\lambda\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & - \\lambda - 1\\\\\\lambda + 1 & \\lambda^{2} - 1\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[B=A^2-2A=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & - \\lambda - 1\\\\\\lambda + 1 & \\lambda^{2} - 1\\end{pmatrix}-\\begin{pmatrix}2 & -2\\\\2 & 2 \\lambda\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-2 & 1 - \\lambda\\\\\\lambda - 1 & \\lambda^{2} - 2 \\lambda - 1\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(B=\\begin{pmatrix}-2 & 1 - \\lambda\\\\\\lambda - 1 & \\lambda^{2} - 2 \\lambda - 1\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[|B|=-2(\\lambda^2-2\\lambda-1)-(1-\\lambda)(\\lambda-1)=-2\\lambda^2+4\\lambda+2+(\\lambda-1)^2=-\\lambda^2+2\\lambda+3\\]<p>\\(|B|=0\\iff\\lambda^2-2\\lambda-3=0\\iff\\lambda=3\\) o \\(\\lambda=-1\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(B\\) tiene inversa si y solo si \\(\\lambda\\neq3\\) y \\(\\lambda\\neq-1\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(\\lambda=1\\): \\(B=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&0\\\\0&-2\\end{pmatrix}=-2I\\), con \\(|B|=4\\neq0\\). Su inversa es \\(-\\frac12I\\) porque \\((-2I)\\left(-\\frac12I\\right)=I\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(B^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}-\\frac12&0\\\\0&-\\frac12\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "matrices",
     "tipo": "ops",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "matrices",
     "tipo": "inv",
     "apartados": "b, c"
    }
   ],
